# Responsive art derivatives — GENERATED by
# scripts/generate-image-derivatives.mjs, called FIRST in the `build` script,
# never committed. (Not a `pre*` hook: .npmrc sets ignore-scripts=true, which
# silently skips those — that mistake once shipped a manifest advertising files
# nothing had built.) Hundreds of files at tens of MB, and public/ is tracked,
# so committing them would put that in every clone.
# The MANIFEST at src/lib/artDerivatives.generated.json IS committed.
#
# The MANIFEST beside them (src/lib/artDerivatives.generated.json, ~16 KB) IS
# committed on purpose: artSrcSet.ts imports it, so tsc and vitest need it to
# exist in a fresh clone that has never run a build.
public/_derived/
